@{
    var resourcePath = "~/Views/MemberRequests/Guidelines/zh-cn/Agent/Styles/";
}
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <meta http-equiv="X-UA-Compatible" content="IE=edge">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=0.7, user-scalable=yes">
    <title>Play For Fun</title>
    <link type="text/css" rel="stylesheet" href="@Url.Content("~/Views/MemberRequests/Guidelines/Style/page.css")" />
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="feature-desc">
            <span>我们已创建了的新功能名为 “免费试玩”的产品在会员网， 它会透过系统传达下线要求开启该产品的信息发送到代理网，这是方便代理们用快速方式启用产品给您的下线。</span>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-images">
            <figure>
                <img src="@Url.Content(resourcePath+"/Images/f1.png")" alt="Fig 1">
                <figcaption>图1：“免费试玩”仪表板</figcaption>
            </figure>
        </div>

        <div class="feature-list">
            <div class="feature">
                <div class="feature-title">1. 启用产品</div>

                <div class="feature-desc">根据这些步骤指示并学习如何开启产品给您的会员</div>

                <div class="step-level">
                    <div class="feature-desc">
                        <span><span class="bold">步骤1</span> 通过以下两种方式之一打开会员要求列表：</span>
                    </div>

                    <div class="alphabet-ordered">
                        <p>a. 在主页，点击要求号码。</p>
                        <div class="feature-images">
                            <figure>
                                <img src="@Url.Content(resourcePath+"/Images/f2.png")" alt="Fig 2">
                                <figcaption>图2. 在主页的免费试玩页面</figcaption>
                            </figure>
                        </div>

                        <p>b. 在会员资料，点击 “免费试玩 - 会员要求 ”</p>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="step-level">
                    <div class="feature-desc">
                        <span class="bold">步骤2.</span> 选择要启用的账号并配置设定。
                    </div>

                    <div class="feature-images">
                        <figure>
                            <img src="@Url.Content(resourcePath+"/Images/f3.png")" alt="Fig 3">
                            <figcaption>图3. “免费试玩 - 会员要求 ”</figcaption>
                        </figure>
                    </div>

                    <ul class="level-1">
                        <li>
                            <span class="bold">动作</span>: 点击打开设置页面。
                            <ul class="level-2">
                                <li>
                                    <span class="icon"><img src="@Url.Content(resourcePath+"/Images/sync.png")" alt="Icon Sync"></span>同步：账号还未与娱乐城同步。
                                </li>
                                <li>
                                    <span class="icon"><img src="@Url.Content(resourcePath+"/Images/pencil.png")" alt="Icon Edit"> </span>编辑：账号已经和娱乐城同步。
                                </li>
                            </ul>
                        </li>

                        <li>
                            会员的余额资料是显示真实货币。
                            <ul class="level-2">
                                <li><span class="bold">余额</span>: 会员的总输赢是包括今天的输赢。</li>
                                <li><span class="bold">未结束交易</span>:  总投注金额票根在进行中。</li>
                                <li><span class="bold">投注额度</span>: 会员可用的总数， 是可以用于下注。</li>
                            </ul>
                        </li>

                        <li>
                            请您联系您的上线如：
                            <ul class="level-2">
                                <li>你无法开启产品，因您的上线还未开启此产品</li>

                                <li class="feature-images">
                                    <figure>
                                        <img src="@Url.Content(resourcePath+"/Images/f4.png")" alt="Fig 4">
                                        <figcaption>图4. 您的上线还未为您的账号开启此产品</figcaption>
                                    </figure>
                                </li>

                                <li>您可以开启此产品但您无法进行配置</li>

                                <li class="feature-images">
                                    <figure>
                                        <img src="@Url.Content(resourcePath+"/Images/f5.png")" alt="Fig 4">
                                        <figcaption>图5. 您的上线还未为您的账号进行产品配置</figcaption>
                                    </figure>
                                </li>
                            </ul>
                        </li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="step-level">
                    <div class="feature-desc">
                        <span class="bold">步骤3.</span> 点击
                        <span class="icon"><img src="@Url.Content(resourcePath+"/Images/sync.png")" alt="Icon Sync"></span> 或
                        <span class="icon"><img src="@Url.Content(resourcePath+"/Images/pencil.png")" alt="Icon Edit"> </span>
                        到设置页面然后在“开启娱乐城” 的格子打钩以开启此产品给指定会员。
                        注意： 首先您必须到您的设定页面进行配置设定方才可开启产品给会员
                    </div>

                    <div class="feature-images">
                        <figure>
                            <img src="@Url.Content(resourcePath+"/Images/f6.png")" alt="Fig 6">
                            <figcaption>图6. 设定页面</figcaption>
                        </figure>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="step-level">
                    <span class="bold">步骤4.</span> 点击按键完成产品启用
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="feature">
                <div class="feature-title">2. 会员免费试玩资料报告 </div>

                <div class="feature-desc">
                    点击产品名称（或是点击在报告栏目的<span class="bold">免费试玩资料</span>）查看已尝试免费试玩的会员资料
                </div>

                <div class="feature-images">
                    <figure>
                        <img src="@Url.Content(resourcePath+"/Images/f7.png")" alt="Fig 7">
                        <figcaption>图7. 免费试玩主页</figcaption>
                    </figure>
                </div>

                <div class="feature-desc">免费试玩报表打开如下</div>

                <div class="feature-images">
                    <figure>
                        <img src="@Url.Content(resourcePath+"/Images/f8.png")" alt="Fig 8">
                        <figcaption>图8. 会员尝试免费试玩资料报告</figcaption>
                    </figure>
                </div>

                <div class="feature-desc">
                    注意：报告总结的会员统计仅根据所选产品的虚拟货币
                    <ul class="level-1">
                        <li>
                            <span class="bold">状态</span>:  会员状态
                            <ul class="level-2">
                                <li><span class="bold">已开启</span>: 账号已开启所选产品</li>
                                <li><span class="bold">已禁用</span>: 账号已禁用所选</li>
                            </ul>
                        </li>
                        <li><span class="bold">投注额</span>: 会员总投注额</li>
                        <li><span class="bold">会员输赢</span>: 会员总输赢</li>
                        <li><span class="bold">投注统计</span>:  总投注注单</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>